---
title: Free Online PDF Tools & Simple Document Utilities
description: Free PDF tools for simple document tasks; choose a file and download a result. Merge, split, compress, edit and convert PDFs with 100% in-browser processing.
bodyClass: hp-body
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}
{% block head %}
<style>
/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
   HOMEPAGE — Warm Editorial Design System
   ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ */
:root { --hp-bg: #f6f5f0; --hp-bg-alt: #efe9de; --hp-bg-dark: #1c1610; --hp-text: #2c2418; --hp-text-secondary: #6b5e4f; --hp-text-muted: #706558; --hp-accent: #8b6914; --hp-accent-hover: #a47d1b; --hp-border: #d9d0c3; --hp-card-bg: transparent; --hp-serif: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; --hp-sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; }
[data-theme="dark"] { --hp-bg: #1a1714; --hp-bg-alt: #242019; --hp-bg-dark: #0f0d0a; --hp-text: #f0ebe2; --hp-text-secondary: #a89e8f; --hp-text-muted: #8c8273; --hp-accent: #d4a942; --hp-accent-hover: #e6be5a; --hp-border: #3a342a; --hp-card-bg: #2a2520; }
body.hp-body { background: var(--hp-bg) !important; color: var(--hp-text) !important; }
body.hp-body main { padding-top: 0 !important; border: none !important; }
body.hp-body section, body.hp-body main { border-top: none !important; border-bottom: none !important; }
body.hp-body .header { background: #f6f5f0 !important; backdrop-filter: none !important; -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important; border: 1px solid #d9d0c3 !important; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(44,36,24,0.08) !important; }
[data-theme="dark"] body.hp-body .header { background: #1a1714 !important; backdrop-filter: none !important; -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important; border: 1px solid #4a4238 !important; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3) !important; }
body.hp-body .header .logo-text { color: var(--hp-text) !important; }
body.hp-body .header .nav-link { color: var(--hp-text-secondary) !important; }
body.hp-body .header .nav-link:hover { color: var(--hp-text) !important; }
body.hp-body .header .theme-toggle { color: var(--hp-text) !important; border: none !important; }
body.hp-body .header .menu-toggle { color: var(--hp-text) !important; }
body.hp-body .header .desktop-only-action { color: var(--hp-text) !important; border: none !important; }
body.hp-body .header .header-search, body.hp-body .header .mobile-search-toggle { display: none !important; }
.hp-hero { position: relative; width: 100%; min-height: auto; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; background: transparent; border: none; }
.hp-hero::before { display: none !important; }
.hp-hero::after { display: none !important; }
.hp-hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 3; text-align: center; max-width: 1200px; padding: 0 24px; padding-top: 96px; padding-bottom: 36px; }
.hp-hero-heading { font-family: var(--hp-serif); font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.2vw, 3rem); font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--hp-accent); max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto 24px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; white-space: normal; text-wrap: balance; }
@media (max-width: 850px) {
  .hp-hero-heading { white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 6vw, 2.5rem); }
}
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .hp-hero-content { width: 100%; max-width: 100%; padding: 28px 20px 28px; box-sizing: border-box; }
  .hp-hero-heading { width: 100%; max-width: 100%; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 8vw, 2.2rem); white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .hp-hero-subtitle { max-width: 100%; white-space: normal !important; }
}
.hp-hero-heading em { font-style: italic; color: var(--hp-accent); }
.hp-hero-subtitle { font-family: var(--hp-sans); font-size: 0.96rem; color: var(--hp-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto 36px; white-space: nowrap; }
@media (max-width: 1024px) { .hp-hero-subtitle { white-space: normal; } }
.hp-hero-ctas { display: flex; gap: 16px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.hp-btn { box-sizing: border-box; font-family: var(--hp-sans); font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 16px 40px; border: 1.5px solid var(--hp-text); border-radius: 6px; background: transparent; color: var(--hp-text); text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); cursor: pointer; display: inline-block; }
.hp-btn:hover { opacity: 0.88; transform: translateY(-1px); }
.hp-btn-filled { background: var(--hp-accent); color: #fff; border-color: var(--hp-accent); }
[data-theme="dark"] .hp-btn-filled { color: #1a1714; }
.hp-btn-filled:hover { background: var(--hp-accent-hover); color: #fff; border-color: var(--hp-accent-hover); }
[data-theme="dark"] .hp-btn-filled:hover { color: #1a1714; }
.hp-section { padding: 90px 24px; }
.hp-container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; }
.hp-label { font-family: var(--hp-sans); font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--hp-text-muted); margin-bottom: 14px; }
.hp-section-heading { font-family: var(--hp-serif); font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; color: var(--hp-accent); line-height: 1.25; margin-bottom: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; text-wrap: balance; }
.hp-section-heading em { font-style: italic; color: var(--hp-accent); }
.hp-section-desc { font-family: var(--hp-sans); font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--hp-text-secondary); line-height: 1.75; max-width: 900px; }

/* Flagship Showcase */
.hp-tools-section { background: var(--hp-bg-alt); }
.hp-tools-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px; }
.hp-tools-header .hp-section-desc { margin: 0 auto; }
.hp-tools-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 36px; }
@media (max-width: 1024px) { .hp-tools-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
@media (max-width: 768px) { .hp-tools-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
.hp-tool-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 16px 18px; height: 100%; background: rgba(255,253,249,0.55); border: 1px solid var(--hp-border); text-decoration: none; color: inherit; transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 8px; }
[data-theme="dark"] .hp-tool-item { background: var(--hp-card-bg); }
.hp-tool-item:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(44,36,24,0.08); border-color: var(--hp-accent); }
.hp-tool-icon-wrap { width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
.hp-tool-icon-wrap svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; stroke: white; fill: none; stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
.hp-tool-content { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.hp-tool-header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 3px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.hp-tool-name { font-family: var(--hp-serif); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--hp-text); margin: 0; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.hp-tool-desc { font-family: var(--hp-sans); font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--hp-text-secondary); line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.hp-tools-cta { text-align: center; }
.hp-btn-warm { box-sizing: border-box; font-family: var(--hp-sans); font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 16px 44px; border: 1.5px solid var(--hp-text); border-radius: 6px; background: transparent; color: var(--hp-text); text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); display: inline-block; }
.hp-btn-warm:hover { opacity: 0.85; border-color: var(--hp-accent); color: var(--hp-accent); transform: translateY(-1px); }

/* Separated Supplementary Study Drafts */
.hp-study-section { background: var(--hp-bg); }
.hp-study-box { border: 1px solid var(--hp-border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 48px 40px; max-width: 950px; margin: 0 auto; background: rgba(255,253,249,0.55); text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box; }
[data-theme="dark"] .hp-study-box { background: var(--hp-card-bg); }
.hp-study-box .hp-section-desc { margin: 0 auto 28px; }

/* Philosophy & Stats */
.hp-philosophy { background: var(--hp-bg); }
.hp-philosophy-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 72px; align-items: center; }
@media (max-width: 1024px) { .hp-philosophy-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; } .hp-philosophy-visual { order: -1; } }
.hp-philosophy-visual { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
.hp-philosophy-art { width: 100%; max-width: 360px; aspect-ratio: 1; position: relative; }
.hp-philosophy-art::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 12%; border: 1.5px solid var(--hp-accent); opacity: 0.38; transform: rotate(45deg); }
.hp-philosophy-art::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 26%; border: 1px solid var(--hp-text-muted); opacity: 0.35; }
.hp-philosophy-art-inner { position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%,-50%); width: 120px; height: 120px; background: var(--hp-accent); opacity: 0.12; border-radius: 50%; }
.hp-feature-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 28px 0 0; }
.hp-feature-list li { font-family: var(--hp-sans); font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--hp-text-secondary); padding: 9px 0; border-bottom: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
.hp-feature-list li::before { content: '·'; font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--hp-accent); line-height: 1; }
.hp-stats { background: var(--hp-bg-dark); padding: 64px 24px; }
.hp-stats-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 32px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
@media (max-width: 768px) { .hp-stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; } }
.hp-stat-number { font-family: var(--hp-serif); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 400; color: #f0ebe2; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.hp-stat-label { font-family: var(--hp-sans); font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(240,235,226,0.35); }

.hp-fade-up { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease; }
.hp-fade-up.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
.hp-info-section { background: var(--hp-bg-alt); }
.hp-workflow-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
.hp-workflow-grid a { display: block; padding: 18px 20px; border: 1px solid var(--hp-border); color: var(--hp-text-secondary); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.5; transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s, transform 0.2s; }
.hp-workflow-grid a span { color: var(--hp-accent); font-weight: 600; }
.hp-workflow-grid a:hover { border-color: var(--hp-accent); color: var(--hp-text); transform: translateY(-2px); }

/* Quick Tool Search */
.hp-search-wrap { max-width: 580px; margin: 28px auto 0; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; }
.hp-search-form { display: flex; align-items: center; position: relative; background: rgba(255,253,249,0.75); border: 1.5px solid var(--hp-border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 4px 6px 4px 18px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(44,36,24,0.06); transition: border-color 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s; }
[data-theme="dark"] .hp-search-form { background: var(--hp-card-bg); border-color: var(--hp-border); box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
.hp-search-form:focus-within { border-color: var(--hp-accent); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(139,105,20,0.15); }
.hp-search-icon { color: var(--hp-text-muted); flex-shrink: 0; margin-right: 12px; }
.hp-search-input { flex: 1; border: none; background: transparent; font-family: var(--hp-sans); font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--hp-text); outline: none; padding: 12px 0; min-width: 0; }
.hp-search-input::placeholder { color: var(--hp-text-muted); }
.hp-search-btn { font-family: var(--hp-sans); font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; background: var(--hp-accent); color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 6px; padding: 11px 22px; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s; white-space: nowrap; flex-shrink: 0; }
[data-theme="dark"] .hp-search-btn { color: #1a1714; }
.hp-search-btn:hover { background: var(--hp-accent-hover); }

/* Editorial & Capabilities Cards */
.hp-editorial-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin-top: 36px; }
.hp-editorial-card { background: rgba(255,253,249,0.55); border: 1px solid var(--hp-border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 32px 28px; box-sizing: border-box; transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s; }
[data-theme="dark"] .hp-editorial-card { background: var(--hp-card-bg); }
.hp-editorial-card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: var(--hp-accent); }
.hp-card-title { font-family: var(--hp-serif); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--hp-text); margin: 0 0 12px; }
.hp-card-text { font-family: var(--hp-sans); font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--hp-text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }

/* How It Works Steps */
.hp-steps-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin-top: 40px; }
.hp-step-card { background: rgba(255,253,249,0.55); border: 1px solid var(--hp-border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 32px 24px; text-align: center; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box; }
[data-theme="dark"] .hp-step-card { background: var(--hp-card-bg); }
.hp-step-num { width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--hp-accent); color: #fff; font-family: var(--hp-serif); font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 18px; }
[data-theme="dark"] .hp-step-num { color: #1a1714; }
.hp-step-title { font-family: var(--hp-serif); font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--hp-text); margin: 0 0 10px; }
.hp-step-desc { font-family: var(--hp-sans); font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--hp-text-secondary); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0; }

/* FAQ Section */
.hp-faq-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin-top: 36px; }
.hp-faq-item { background: rgba(255,253,249,0.55); border: 1px solid var(--hp-border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 26px 24px; box-sizing: border-box; }
[data-theme="dark"] .hp-faq-item { background: var(--hp-card-bg); }
.hp-faq-q { font-family: var(--hp-serif); font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--hp-text); margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.4; }
.hp-faq-a { font-family: var(--hp-sans); font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--hp-text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }

@media (max-width: 850px) {
  .hp-editorial-grid, .hp-steps-grid, .hp-faq-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 18px; }
  .hp-search-form { flex-direction: column; padding: 12px; gap: 10px; }
  .hp-search-btn { width: 100%; text-align: center; }
  .hp-search-icon { display: none; }
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .hp-section { padding: 48px 16px; box-sizing: border-box; }
  .hp-container { width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; }
  .hp-hero-ctas { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  .hp-btn, .hp-btn-warm { box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; max-width: 280px; text-align: center; padding: 14px 20px; }
  .hp-philosophy-art { max-width: 240px; }
.hp-tool-item { padding: 14px 16px; gap: 14px; box-sizing: border-box; }
.hp-study-box { padding: 28px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; }
  .hp-workflow-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; }
}
</style>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<!-- ═══════ HERO ═══════ -->
<section class="hp-hero">
    <div class="hp-hero-content">
        <h1 class="hp-hero-heading"><em>Free PDF Tools for Simple Document Tasks</em></h1>
        <p class="hp-hero-subtitle">Merge, compress, edit, and convert PDFs privately in your browser — plus free college study PDFs.</p>
        <div class="hp-hero-ctas">
            <a href="{{ '/tools' | url }}" class="hp-btn hp-btn-filled">Explore Tools</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hp-search-wrap">
            <form action="{{ '/tools' | url }}" method="get" class="hp-search-form" role="search">
                <svg class="hp-search-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
                <input type="search" name="q" class="hp-search-input" placeholder="Search 46+ tools: merge, compress, edit, word to pdf..." aria-label="Search free PDF tools" autocomplete="off"/>
                <button type="submit" class="hp-search-btn">Search Tools</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════ FIVE FLAGSHIP WORKFLOWS (ABOVE THE DIRECTORY) ═══════ -->
<section class="hp-section hp-tools-section" id="flagship">
    <div class="hp-container">
        <div class="hp-tools-header hp-fade-up">
            <p class="hp-label">Start Here</p>
            <h2 class="hp-section-heading">Free tools for <em>real document tasks</em></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="hp-tools-grid">
            {% for tool in toolRegistry.tools %}
            {% if tool.featured %}
            <a href="{{ tool.href | url }}" class="hp-tool-item hp-fade-up">
                <div class="hp-tool-icon-wrap" style="background: {{ tool.color }};"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">{{ tool.svg | safe }}</svg></div>
                <div class="hp-tool-content">
                    <div class="hp-tool-header">
                        <div class="hp-tool-name">{{ tool.name }}</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hp-tool-desc">{{ tool.desc }}</div>
                </div>
            </a>
            {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <div class="hp-tools-cta hp-fade-up">
            <a href="{{ '/tools' | url }}" class="hp-btn-warm">View All 46 Free Tools</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════ PHILOSOPHY ═══════ -->
<section class="hp-section hp-philosophy">
    <div class="hp-container">
        <div class="hp-philosophy-grid">
            <div class="hp-philosophy-visual hp-fade-up">
                <div class="hp-philosophy-art">
                    <div class="hp-philosophy-art-inner"></div>
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 300 300" role="img" aria-label="PRIVACY FREEDOM SIMPLICITY SECURITY TRUST" style="width:100%;height:100%;position:absolute;inset:0;" fill="none" stroke="var(--hp-accent)" stroke-width="0.75">
                        <text x="150" y="70" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'Playfair Display',serif" font-size="13" fill="var(--hp-text)" stroke="none" opacity="0.68" style="letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase;">PRIVACY</text>
                        <text x="150" y="110" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'Playfair Display',serif" font-size="13" fill="var(--hp-text)" stroke="none" opacity="0.58" style="letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase;">FREEDOM</text>
                        <text x="150" y="150" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'Playfair Display',serif" font-size="13.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--hp-accent)" stroke="none" opacity="0.95" style="letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase;">SIMPLICITY</text>
                        <text x="150" y="190" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'Playfair Display',serif" font-size="13" fill="var(--hp-text)" stroke="none" opacity="0.62" style="letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase;">SECURITY</text>
                        <text x="150" y="230" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'Playfair Display',serif" font-size="13" fill="var(--hp-text)" stroke="none" opacity="0.55" style="letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase;">TRUST</text>
                    </svg>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hp-fade-up">
                <p class="hp-label">Our Philosophy</p>
                <h2 class="hp-section-heading">Built <em>Different</em></h2>
                <p class="hp-section-desc">Know what a tool can preserve before you use it. Our tools explain page order, readable exports, compression tradeoffs and why cropping is not redaction.</p>
                <ul class="hp-feature-list">
                    <li>Free PDF tools, no hidden tool charges</li>
                    <li>No signup required for PDF tools or study materials</li>
                    <li>Clear processing and privacy information</li>
                    <li>Free study materials for college studies — view and download PDFs</li>
                    <li>Mobile layouts with clearly stated browser and memory limits</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


<!-- ═══════ FREE STUDY MATERIALS FOR COLLEGE STUDIES ═══════ -->
<section class="hp-section hp-study-section" id="study-drafts">
    <div class="hp-container">
        <div class="hp-study-box hp-fade-up">
            <p class="hp-label">Free College Resources</p>
            <h2 class="hp-section-heading">Free Study Materials for <em>College Studies</em></h2>
            <p class="hp-section-desc">Looking for structured exam revision? Read and download our 51-page written Database Management Systems (DBMS) PDF study notes for free — no sign-in or payment required.</p>
            <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap;">
                <a href="{{ '/study-materials' | url }}" class="hp-btn hp-btn-filled">View Free Study Materials</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════ ZERO-UPLOAD PRIVACY & SECURITY ARCHITECTURE ═══════ -->
<section class="hp-section hp-info-section" id="security-architecture">
    <div class="hp-container">
        <div class="hp-fade-up" style="max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
            <p class="hp-label">Privacy by Design</p>
            <h2 class="hp-section-heading">Zero Cloud Uploads: Why <em>In-Browser Processing</em> Matters</h2>
            <p class="hp-section-desc" style="margin: 0 auto;">Most online document converters force you to upload sensitive personal or corporate documents to external cloud servers. Once transmitted, your contracts, tax filings, legal agreements, and invoices sit in remote storage queues, exposing confidential records to server vulnerabilities, misconfigurations, and automated data scraping.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hp-editorial-grid hp-fade-up">
            <div class="hp-editorial-card">
